     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Fe chelation removes transfusional Fe; USU started when ferritin = > 1000 ng/mL or after about 1-2 years of scheduled transfusions."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
