    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Luspatercept (injectable TGF-beta pathway inhibitor) = an option for transfusion-dependent pts; in one trial it cut transfusion needs by 33% in 21% of pts (vs 4.5% of controls)."
     }
    ]
   }
